          "text": "Nzosangangura inzu yo kubamwo mu gihe c’ imbeho hamwe n’iyo kubamwo mu gihe c’ubushuhe; kand’ amazu asharijwe n’amahembe y’inzovu azokomvomvorwa, amazu menshi azohenebēra, ni k’Uhoraho agize.",
